Z||000011||Monkeyman||07-02-2000||10:22 AM||||Assuming the car's stock, it's not white.  It's light gray.  I don't know about other cars, but the Fiero didn't have a 3rd brake light until '86.  I took the one out of the Monkeymobile ('86 2m4) and put it in the Grape Ape ('85 GT).  Still have to wire it up.  (Now just where was that thread about wiring up the 3rd brake light?)<P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||1
